Z||000000||Haze_Performance||12-19-2000||01:38 PM||||There's been a few people asking about the wheels that will fit the Fiero. I guess It's time to repost my list <BR>Here’s a list of wheels that will fit our cars<P>I put this wheel list together by using lists from: Weld Racing, Centerline Wheel, American Racing & Billet Wheels. There are some stock wheels out there that will fit but are not on this list. <P><BR><B>BUICK</B><BR>SKYHAWK, SKYLARK, 88-UP<BR>SOMERSET <P><B>CADILLAC</B><BR>CIMARRON 81-88 <P><B>CHEVY</B><BR>BERETTA, CORSICA 87-97 <BR>GTU, GTZ, Z-26 89-97 <P>CAVALIER 81-UP <BR>Z24 89-UP <P>CELEBRITY 82-90 <P>CITATION 80-85 <BR>X-11 81-85 <P>MALIBU, 97-UP <P><B>CHRYSLER</B><BR>LEBARON 86-95<P>LASER, GTS 85-88<P>NEW YORKER 86-93<P>SEBRING CONVERTIBLE 96-UP<P><B>DODGE</B><BR>ARIES, 400, 600 86-88<P>DAYTONA, TURBO Z 85-93<P>DYNASTY 88-93<P>NEON 5-LUG 95-UP<P>LANCER 85-89<P>SHADOW 87-94<P>SPIRIT 89-94<P>STRATUS 95-UP<P><B>LEXUS</B><BR>ES, 250 90-93<P><B>OLDSMOBILE</B><BR>ACHIEVA 92-97<P>CUTLASS CALAIS, 82-89<BR>CIERA, FIRENZA<P><B>PLYMOUTH</B><BR>ACCLAIM 89-95<P>BREEZE 95-UP<P>LASER 85-89<P>NEON 5-LUG 95-UP<P>RELIANT, TOURISMO 85-89<P>SUNDANCE 87-94<P><B>PONTIAC</B><BR>6000, LE 82-90<P>FIERO, GT 84-88<P>GRAND AM 85-98<P>SUNBIRD, 82-94<P>SUNFIRE GT 95-UP<P><B>TOYOTA</B><BR>CAMRY 86-91<P>CELICA 92-UP<P><B>VOLKSWAGEN</B><BR>BEETLE 97-UP<P>CORRADO VR6 92-93<P>JETTA (4CYL) 99-UP<P>JETTA VR6 93-UP<P>GLX VR6 92-98<P>GOLF 2000<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlogo1_1.gif">     <BR><B>"AHHHHH!!! All Fiero's don't start on fire you BONEHEAD!!"</B><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 12-19-2000).]||||reg||10
