Z||000002||Raydar||12-20-2000||11:04 AM||||I belive that many of the newer Subaru wheels will fit. Some of them don't look half bad.<BR>This one is from 16x6.5, 5x100mm. <A HREF="http://www.aaarims.com/wheels/68699.JPG" TARGET=_blank>http://www.aaarims.com/wheels/68699.JPG</A> <P>Also have a question. I have seen several Fieros with Dodge Daytona wheels installed. I have heard that there is some interference on the rear of the 88s, due to the wider spring seat (or something). Can anyone verify that this is right or wrong? <BR>TIA.<P>Raydar||||reg||1
